# Providers the production gateway holds tokens for, beside gateway.keys (render_env.py). MODEL_PROVIDERS in
# fly/agent-proxy.toml decides which one serves; these carry the LiteLLM upstream production keeps on Fly, so
# naming it there is a toml change and not a secrets hunt.
PROVIDER_LITELLM_BASE?
PROVIDER_LITELLM_MODEL?
PROVIDER_LITELLM_TOKEN?
PROVIDER_LITELLM_NO_CACHE?
